'''The Summit (SVE)''' is a [[Locations|location]] that replaces the vanilla map of [[Stardew:The Summit|The Summit]].<br> This area is only accessible by completing [[Quests|The Railroad Boulder Quest]] from Clint. Obtaining the [[Stardew:Skull Key|Skull Key ]] from floor 120 in [[Stardew:The Mines|the mines]] will lead to this quest being triggered. 
{{TOC}}
